        "entry_hxX4LR": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Can I vacuum artificial grass?",
            "text": "<p>Artificial grass requires a specialist vacuum that can gently clean the lawn without damaging the fibres or dislodging the sand foundation. Our testing has shown that artificial grass cleans best when it’s wet and that using an outdoor brush is hard work and inefficient. That’s why we developed the first wet and dry vacuum cleaner specifically for artificial lawns and gardens. The <a href=\"/products/vacmaster-wd-18-ag\" title=\"Vacmaster WD18 | Garden & Artificial Grass Vacuum Cleaner\">Vacmaster WD 18 AG</a> is a pioneering vacuum designed to clean muddy water and dirt directly from astro-turf, patio, or decking.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
